26 National Wrestling Coaches Association (NWCA) All-Star Classic at Rec Hall on the campus of Penn State University in University Park, Pennsylvania, on Tuesday night.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/SZ9_6224-2.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/SZ9_6224-2.jpg"><media:title>Ty Watters wrestles against Collin Gaj at the NWCA All-Star Classic on Nov. 24, 2026.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/SZ9_6224-2.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:58:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>18</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59759</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Open Battle 4 Atlantis with Win Over Florida</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/24/womens-basketball-mountaineers-open-battle-4-atlantis-with-win-over-florida</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/24/womens-basketball-mountaineers-open-battle-4-atlantis-with-win-over-florida</guid><category>Women's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Khyala Ngodu blocks a shot during a game against Florida at the Battle 4 Atlantis" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/24/0U2A2304.JPG" /><br /><br />PARADISE ISLAND, Bahamas – The No. 22 West Virginia Mountaineers improved to 6-0 on the season with a 70-62 victory over Florida at Atlantis Resort in the Bahamas on Tuesday afternoon during the Battle 4 Atlantis. WVU used a strong second quarter and a balanced offensive effort to withstand a second-half push from the Gators to remain unbeaten.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/0U2A2304.JPG" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/0U2A2304.JPG"><media:title>Khyala Ngodu blocks a shot during a game against Florida at the Battle 4 Atlantis</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/24/0U2A2304.JPG" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:32:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59758</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>